<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#ff7db8" />
  <title>Happy 3 Months, Babe ❤️</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg-1: #fff2f7;
      --bg-2: #ffd6e8;
      --surface: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.78);
      --surface-solid: #ffffff;
      --text: #4b2132;
      --muted: #7a5161;
      --accent: #ff6fae;
      --accent-2: #9d6cff;
      --border: rgba(255,255,255,.62);
      --shadow: 0 24px 60px rgba(111, 35, 72, 0.16);
      --radius: 28px;
    }

    body[data-theme="midnight"] {
      --bg-1: #100d1d;
      --bg-2: #2a1638;
      --surface: rgba(37, 24, 50, 0.84);
      --surface-solid: #291b36;
      --text: #fff4fb;
      --muted: #d3bdd0;
      --accent: #ff79bb;
      --accent-2: #9e8cff;
      --border: rgba(255,255,255,.08);
      --shadow: 0 24px 70px rgba(0,0,0,.34);
    }

    body[data-theme="sunset"] {
      --bg-1: #fff3d9;
      --bg-2: #ffb4a2;
      --surface: rgba(255, 250, 239, .82);
      --surface-solid: #fff9ef;
      --text: #5b2a24;
      --muted: #85544b;
      --accent: #ff6b6b;
      --accent-2: #ff9f43;
      --border: rgba(255,255,255,.62);
      --shadow: 0 24px 60px rgba(118, 54, 37, .18);
    }

    body[data-theme="ocean"] {
      --bg-1: #e8fbff;
      --bg-2: #b8dfff;
      --surface: rgba(245, 253, 255, .82);
      --surface-solid: #f7fdff;
      --text: #183a4a;
      --muted: #4e7587;
      --accent: #2fa8cc;
      --accent-2: #7b61ff;
      --border: rgba(255,255,255,.7);
      --shadow: 0 24px 60px rgba(22, 86, 116, .16);
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      min-height: 100vh;
      overflow-x: hidden;
      font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
      color: var(--text);
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at top left, rgba(255,255,255,.65), transparent 36%),
        linear-gradient(135deg, var(--bg-1), var(--bg-2));
      transition: background .45s ease, color .35s ease;
    }

    body::before {
      content: "";
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      pointer-events: none;
      opacity: .28;
      background-image: radial-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,.75) 1px, transparent 1px);
      background-size: 22px 22px;
      mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, black, transparent 80%);
      z-index: -1;
    }

    button, a { font: inherit; }
    img { max-width: 100%; display: block; }

    .topbar {
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 30;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      padding: 14px clamp(16px, 4vw, 42px);
      backdrop-filter: blur(18px);
      background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--surface) 88%, transparent);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .brand {
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: -.02em;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .theme-switcher {
      display: flex;
      gap: 8px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      justify-content: flex-end;
    }

    .theme-dot {
      width: 35px;
      height: 35px;
      border: 2px solid rgba(255,255,255,.65);
      border-radius: 50%;
      cursor: pointer;
      box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.12);
      transition: transform .2s ease;
    }

    .theme-dot:hover, .theme-dot.active { transform: translateY(-2px) scale(1.08); }
    .theme-dot[data-set-theme="rose"] { background: linear-gradient(135deg,#ff7db8,#ffd6e8); }
    .theme-dot[data-set-theme="midnight"] { background: linear-gradient(135deg,#151020,#8c4bbd); }
    .theme-dot[data-set-theme="sunset"] { background: linear-gradient(135deg,#ff7a7a,#ffc56b); }
    .theme-dot[data-set-theme="ocean"] { background: linear-gradient(135deg,#28a8cc,#8b7cff); }

    .hero {
      min-height: 88vh;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      padding: 88px 20px 70px;
      text-align: center;
      position: relative;
    }

    .hero-inner { max-width: 900px; }

    .eyebrow {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      padding: 9px 14px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      background: var(--surface);
      border-radius: 999px;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.08);
      backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(3.2rem, 9vw, 7.2rem);
      line-height: .92;
      margin: 24px 0 20px;
      letter-spacing: -.065em;
    }

    .gradient-text {
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--accent), var(--accent-2));
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      background-clip: text;
      color: transparent;
    }

    .subtitle {
      max-width: 680px;
      margin: 0 auto 28px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 2.2vw, 1.35rem);
      line-height: 1.65;
    }

    .hero-actions {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .btn {
      border: 0;
      cursor: pointer;
      border-radius: 999px;
      padding: 14px 22px;
      font-weight: 800;
      text-decoration: none;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 8px;
      transition: transform .2s ease, box-shadow .2s ease, background .25s ease;
    }

    .btn:hover { transform: translateY(-3px); }
    .btn-primary { color: white; background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent), var(--accent-2)); box-shadow: 0 14px 30px color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 38%, transparent); }
    .btn-secondary { color: var(--text); background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--border); backdrop-filter: blur(15px); }

    main { width: min(1120px, calc(100% - 28px)); margin: 0 auto 70px; }

    .section {
      margin: 26px 0;
      padding: clamp(24px, 4vw, 44px);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      background: var(--surface);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
      overflow: hidden;
      position: relative;
    }

    .section::after {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      width: 180px;
      height: 180px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: radial-gradient(circle, color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 22%, transparent), transparent 65%);
      top: -70px;
      right: -60px;
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .section-heading { margin-bottom: 24px; }
    .section h2 { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.7rem); letter-spacing: -.04em; }
    .section p { line-height: 1.7; }
    .muted { color: var(--muted); }

    .message-card {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.1fr .9fr;
      gap: 28px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .quote {
      font-size: clamp(1.2rem, 2.4vw, 1.55rem);
      line-height: 1.7;
      margin: 0;
    }

    .mini-card {
      padding: 24px;
      border-radius: 22px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 16%, var(--surface-solid)), color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent-2) 13%, var(--surface-solid)));
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .album-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
      gap: 14px;
    }

    .photo-card {
      position: relative;
      border: 0;
      padding: 0;
      background: none;
      border-radius: 22px;
      overflow: hidden;
      aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;
      cursor: pointer;
      box-shadow: 0 12px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.13);
      transform: translateZ(0);
    }

    .photo-card img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      object-fit: cover;
      transition: transform .45s ease, filter .35s ease;
    }

    .photo-card::after {
      content: attr(data-caption);
      position: absolute;
      inset: auto 0 0;
      padding: 34px 14px 13px;
      color: white;
      font-weight: 750;
      text-align: left;
      background: linear-gradient(transparent, rgba(0,0,0,.75));
      transform: translateY(25%);
      opacity: 0;
      transition: .3s ease;
    }

    .photo-card:hover img { transform: scale(1.08); filter: saturate(1.08); }
    .photo-card:hover::after { transform: translateY(0); opacity: 1; }

    .album-tip { margin-top: 16px; font-size: .95rem; color: var(--muted); }

    .timeline {
      display: grid;
      gap: 16px;
      position: relative;
    }

    .timeline-item {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 48px 1fr;
      gap: 14px;
      align-items: start;
      padding: 18px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--surface-solid) 72%, transparent);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .timeline-icon {
      width: 48px;
      height: 48px;
      border-radius: 16px;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent), var(--accent-2));
      color: white;
      font-size: 1.25rem;
    }

    .timeline-item h3 { margin: 0 0 6px; }
    .timeline-item p { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); }

    .playlist-card {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 230px 1fr;
      gap: 28px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .album-cover {
      aspect-ratio: 1;
      border-radius: 24px;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      font-size: 4rem;
      background:
        linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(255,255,255,.25), transparent),
        linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent), var(--accent-2));
      box-shadow: 0 18px 35px color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 32%, transparent);
      color: white;
    }

    .track-list {
      display: grid;
      gap: 9px;
      margin: 18px 0 22px;
    }

    .track {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      padding: 11px 13px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--surface-solid) 72%, transparent);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .track-number { width: 24px; color: var(--muted); font-weight: 800; }

    .stats-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
      gap: 14px;
    }

    .stat-card {
      text-align: center;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--surface-solid) 75%, transparent);
      border-radius: 22px;
      padding: 24px 16px;
    }

    .stat-value { font-size: 2.2rem; font-weight: 900; background: linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2)); -webkit-background-clip: text; color: transparent; }
    .stat-label { color: var(--muted); margin-top: 4px; }

    .notes-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4,1fr); gap: 12px; }
    .note-btn {
      min-height: 110px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 20px;
      background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--surface-solid) 74%, transparent);
      color: var(--text);
      cursor: pointer;
      font-size: 2rem;
      transition: .25s ease;
    }
    .note-btn:hover { transform: translateY(-5px) rotate(-1deg); box-shadow: 0 14px 26px rgba(0,0,0,.1); }

    .reason-box { text-align: center; padding: 26px; border-radius: 22px; background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--surface-solid) 74%, transparent); border: 1px solid var(--border); }
    #reason { min-height: 60px; font-size: 1.35rem; font-weight: 750; }

    .finale { text-align: center; }
    .finale h2 { font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 6vw, 4.2rem); }

    footer { text-align: center; color: var(--muted); padding: 0 20px 48px; }

    .modal {
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      display: none;
      place-items: center;
      padding: 20px;
      background: rgba(9, 7, 13, .82);
      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      z-index: 100;
    }

    .modal.open { display: grid; }

    .modal-content {
      width: min(920px, 100%);
      max-height: 92vh;
      border-radius: 24px;
      overflow: hidden;
      background: var(--surface-solid);
      box-shadow: 0 30px 90px rgba(0,0,0,.45);
      position: relative;
    }

    .modal-content img { width: 100%; max-height: 72vh; object-fit: contain; background: #090909; }
    .modal-caption { padding: 18px 64px 20px 20px; font-weight: 700; }
    .modal-close {
      position: absolute;
      top: 14px;
      right: 14px;
      width: 42px;
      height: 42px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      border: 0;
      background: rgba(0,0,0,.62);
      color: white;
      cursor: pointer;
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      z-index: 2;
    }

    .toast {
      position: fixed;
      left: 50%;
      bottom: 28px;
      transform: translate(-50%, 20px);
      max-width: min(520px, calc(100% - 32px));
      padding: 15px 18px;
      border-radius: 16px;
      background: #17131d;
      color: white;
      box-shadow: 0 18px 45px rgba(0,0,0,.28);
      opacity: 0;
      pointer-events: none;
      transition: .3s ease;
      z-index: 150;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .toast.show { opacity: 1; transform: translate(-50%, 0); }

    .floating { position: fixed; top: -30px; pointer-events: none; z-index: 90; animation: fall linear forwards; }
    @keyframes fall { to { transform: translateY(110vh) rotate(420deg); opacity: 0; } }
    @keyframes reveal { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(22px); } to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); } }
    .reveal { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(22px); }
    .reveal.visible { animation: reveal .75s ease forwards; }

    @media (max-width: 860px) {
      .message-card, .playlist-card { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .album-cover { max-width: 240px; }
      .album-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(3,1fr); }
      .stats-grid, .notes-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2,1fr); }
    }

    @media (max-width: 560px) {
      .topbar { align-items: flex-start; }
      .brand { padding-top: 8px; }
      .theme-switcher { max-width: 180px; }
      .hero { min-height: 80vh; padding-top: 70px; }
      .album-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2,1fr); gap: 10px; }
      .section { border-radius: 22px; }
      .stats-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
    }

    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      *, *::before, *::after { scroll-behavior: auto !important; animation-duration: .01ms !important; animation-iteration-count: 1 !important; transition-duration: .01ms !important; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body data-theme="rose">
  <nav class="topbar">
    <div class="brand">Nathan + Jay · 3 Months</div>
    <div class="theme-switcher" aria-label="Choose a theme">
      <button class="theme-dot active" data-set-theme="rose" title="Rose" aria-label="Rose theme"></button>
      <button class="theme-dot" data-set-theme="midnight" title="Midnight" aria-label="Midnight theme"></button>
      <button class="theme-dot" data-set-theme="sunset" title="Sunset" aria-label="Sunset theme"></button>
      <button class="theme-dot" data-set-theme="ocean" title="Ocean" aria-label="Ocean theme"></button>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <header class="hero">
    <div class="hero-inner">
      <div class="eyebrow">❤️ Chapter Three</div>
      <h1>Happy <span class="gradient-text">3 Months</span>, Babe</h1>
      <p class="subtitle">Three months of Jay and Nathan: more pictures, more memories, more FaceTimes, and somehow even more reasons I like you.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#letter">Open your surprise</a>
        <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="#album">View our album</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="section reveal" id="letter">
      <div class="message-card">
        <div>
          <div class="section-heading">
            <h2>My message to you</h2>
            <p class="muted">A little update for month three.</p>
          </div>
          <p class="quote">I’m really grateful for these past three months with you. Even with distance, busy schedules, stress, and life being life, I still feel lucky that I get to call you mine. I love our laughs, our FaceTimes, our visits, and all the tiny moments that have become part of us. I know we are still at the beginning, but I am really happy that this beginning is with you.</p>
