    </section>

    <section class="section reveal">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <h2>Our month-three memories</h2>
        <p class="muted">Replace these with exact dates, places, jokes, or moments from this month.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="timeline">
        <div class="timeline-item"><div class="timeline-icon">📍</div><div><h3>Our favorite visit</h3><p>Write what you did, where you went, and the tiny detail you never want to forget.</p></div></div>
        <div class="timeline-item"><div class="timeline-icon">📞</div><div><h3>The FaceTime that lasted forever</h3><p>Add the joke, conversation, or moment that made it memorable.</p></div></div>
