      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section reveal" id="playlist">
      <div class="playlist-card">
        <div class="album-cover">🎧</div>
        <div>
          <div class="section-heading">
            <h2>Our new playlist</h2>
            <p class="muted">A new soundtrack for chapter three.</p>
          </div>
          <p>I made another playlist because apparently one was not enough. These songs made me think about you, us, missing you, seeing you again, and all the feelings I am pretending are completely normal.</p>
